#: cmdline/apt-cache.cc:1096
msgid ""
"Usage: apt-cache [options] command\n"
"       apt-cache [options] show pkg1 [pkg2 ...]\n"
"\n"
"apt-cache queries and displays available information about installed\n"
"and installable packages. It works exclusively on the data acquired\n"
"into the local cache via the 'update' command of e.g. apt-get. The\n"
"displayed information may therefore be outdated if the last update was\n"
"too long ago, but in exchange apt-cache works independently of the\n"
"availability of the configured sources (e.g. offline).\n"
msgstr ""
"Gebruik: apt-cache [opsies] bevel\n"
"       apt-cache [opsies] show pkt1 [pkt2 ...]\n"
"\n"
"apt-cache doen navraag en wys beskikbare informasie oor pakkette\n"
"wat geïnstalleerd is of installeerbaar is.  Dit werk ekslusief op data\n"
"wat verkry is in die lokale stoorplek vir die 'update' bevel bv. apt-get\n"
"Die inligting wat gewys word mag dalk oud wees na die laaste keer\n"
"wat dit opgedateer was en tè oud kan wees, maar apt-cache werk\n"
"onafhangklik van die beskikbaarheid van gekonfigeerde bronne (bv. aflyn).\n"

#: cmdline/apt-cache.cc:1112
msgid "Show source records"
msgstr "Wys brond rekords"

#: cmdline/apt-cache.cc:1118
msgid "Search the package list for a regex pattern"
msgstr "Die soektog van die pakketlys vir regex patroon"

#: cmdline/apt-cache.cc:1119
